{"id": "56554", "title": "狂野／爱上爱，爱上痛，爱上家", "author": "夏广寒", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 28, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/56/56554.htm", "intro": "深夜，电梯开开合合， \r\n　　冷魅的总裁大人与美艳的公关小姐大胆上演一出情色戏码… \r\n　　没关系，这时候，所有的人都下班了，只要关掉电梯里的摄像头，那就可以，安全的享受到狂野的性… \r\n　　电梯门再一次静消消地滑开… \r\n　　一位失魂落魄的少女站在电梯外，电梯内的动作依旧，少女却一步一步踏了进来… \r\n　　冷魅的总裁大人旁若无人… \r\n　　失魂落魄的少女视而不见… \r\n　　美艳的公关小姐仓皇逃窜… \r\n　　ooxx \r\n　　是爱情还是狂野不羁的孽缘，纠缠交错…… \r\n　　可以为你死，却不可以爱你…… \r\n　　可以为你付出一切，却永远也得不到你的心…… \r\n　　受过伤害，就有权利伤害…… \r\n　　尝过苦痛，才想用最柔软的肉体来包裹你尖锐的爪牙…… \r\n　　没有信任，一切都是空谈…… \r\n　　ooxx \r\n　　本文不同与夏夏以往的作品的风格，不色不白，慢文小虐、当然结局美好。欲入从速", "base": "files/article/html/56/56554", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "7929692.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "7929695.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "7929696.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "7929697.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "7929700.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "7929702.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "7929704.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-60", "file": "7929709.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-70", "file": "7929710.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-80", "file": "7929714.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-90", "file": "7929718.html", "available": false}, {"title": "91--尾声", "file": "7929720.html", "available": false}, {"title": "1-10", "file": "7929722.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "7929725.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "7929729.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "7929731.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "7929733.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-60", "file": "7929738.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-70", "file": "7929742.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-80", "file": "7929745.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81--结尾", "file": "7929748.html", "a